    this card is Normal Summoned: You can add 1 Level 7 or higher Winged Beast monster
    from your Deck to your hand, then immediately after this effect resolves, you
    can Normal Summon 1 Winged Beast monster. If a Winged Beast monster is Normal
    Summoned to your field while this card is banished: You can add this card to
    your hand.'
